    rr:predicateObjectMap [ rr:predicate <http://example.org/attribute/attribute_name> ; rr:objectMap [ rr:column "attribute_name" ; rr:datatype xsd:string ] ;
        rdfs:label "attribute name"@en ;
        rdfs:comment "the attribute. commonsense evidence: A superhero's attribute is a characteristic or quality that defines who they are and what they are capable of. This could be a physical trait, such as superhuman strength or the ability to fly, or a personal trait, such as extraordinary intelligence or exceptional bravery."@en ] .

